    @startuml 顺序图-文档导出详细
    ' ============================================
    ' 用例1：学术文档高保真导出 - 详细顺序图
    ' 基于实际代码：DocumentConversionEngine + PandocPipeline
    ' 参与者 → 边界类 → 控制类 → 实体类 → 外部系统
    ' ============================================

    skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
    skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    skinparam sequenceActorBackgroundColor #FDEBD0
    skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #E67E22
    skinparam sequenceBoxBackgroundColor #F8F9F9
    skinparam sequenceBoxBorderColor #BDC3C7
    skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FCF3CF
    skinparam noteBorderColor #F39C12
    skinparam maxMessageSize 300

    title 用例1：学术文档高保真导出 — 详细顺序图

    ' ========================================
    ' 参与者定义
    ' ========================================
    actor "用户\n(研究者/学生)" as User

    ' 边界类
    box "边界类 (Boundary)" #E8F8F5
        participant "ConvertTab\n(转换界面)" as ConvertTab
    end box

    ' 控制类
    box "控制类 (Control)" #FDEDEC
        participant "DocumentConversionEngine\n(文档转换引擎)" as Engine
        participant "PandocPipeline\n(Pandoc管线)" as Pandoc
        participant "ConfigManager\n(配置管理器)" as Config
        participant "OpenXmlStyleCorrector\n(样式修正器)" as StyleCorrector
    end box

    ' 实体类
    box "实体类 (Entity)" #F2F3F4
        participant "AfdParser\n(AFD解析器)" as Parser
        participant "ReferenceDocBuilder\n(参考文档构建器)" as RefBuilder
        participant "AfdTemplate\n(AFD样式模板)" as Template
        participant "TemplateRepository\n(模板仓库)" as Repo
    end box

    ' 外部系统
    box "外部系统 / 基础设施" #FADBD8
        participant "IPdfConverter\n(PDF转换策略)" as PdfConv
        participant "Pandoc CLI\n(转换引擎)" as PandocCLI
        participant "FileSystem\n(文件系统)" as FS
    end box

    ' ========================================
    ' 交互流程
    ' ========================================

    == 阶段1：用户发起导出请求 ==

    User -> ConvertTab : 1. 选择MD文件、模板、格式\n点击"转换"
    activate ConvertTab

    ConvertTab -> ConvertTab : 2. 校验输入参数\n(文件存在、输出路径合法)

    ConvertTab -> Engine : 3. ConvertAsync(mdPath,\ntemplateId, format, pdfLayout, ct)
    activate Engine

    == 阶段2：加载AFD样式模板 ==

    Engine -> Config : 4. GetTemplateAsync(templateId)
    activate Config

    Config -> Repo : 5. GetMetaAsync(templateId)
    activate Repo
    Repo -> Repo : 6. SELECT * FROM templates\nWHERE template_id = ?
    Repo --> Config : AfdMeta (模板元数据)
    deactivate Repo

    Config -> Parser : 7. Parse(jsonPath)
    activate Parser
    Parser -> FS : 8. 读取 JSON 模板文件
    activate FS
    FS --> Parser : 9. JSON 文本内容
    deactivate FS
    Parser -> Parser : 10. 反序列化为 AfdTemplate\n校验必填字段
    Parser --> Config : 11. AfdTemplate 实体
    deactivate Parser

    Config --> Engine : 12. AfdTemplate
    deactivate Config

    == 阶段3：构建Pandoc参考文档(reference.docx) ==

    Engine -> RefBuilder : 13. Build(refDocPath, template)
    activate RefBuilder
    RefBuilder -> RefBuilder : 14. 使用 OpenXML API\n创建 reference.docx\n写入页面设置、样式定义\n页眉页脚
    RefBuilder --> Engine : 15. refDocPath 已生成
    deactivate RefBuilder

    == 阶段4：Markdown预处理 ==

    Engine -> Engine : 16. 调用 MarkdownHtmlTableNormalizer\nHTML表格 → pipe表格
    Engine -> Engine : 17. 调用 MarkdownMathNormalizer\n\\textcircled{} → Unicode
    Engine -> Engine : 18. 调用 MarkdownHtmlImageNormalizer\n<img> → MD图片语法
    Engine -> FS : 19. 写入预处理后的临时MD文件
    activate FS
    FS --> Engine : 20. tempMdPath
    deactivate FS

    == 阶段5：Pandoc执行MD→DOCX转换 ==

    Engine -> Pandoc : 21. ToDocxAsync(tempMdPath,\noutputDocx, refDocPath, luaFilter, ct)
    activate Pandoc

    Pandoc -> Pandoc : 22. 发现 Lua 筛选器\n(assign-block-styles.lua\nafd-heading-filter.lua)

    Pandoc -> PandocCLI : 23. 启动 Pandoc 子进程\npandoc --from markdown\n--to docx\n--reference-doc=ref.docx\n--lua-filter=xxx.lua\n-o output.docx
    activate PandocCLI

    PandocCLI -> PandocCLI : 24. 执行文档转换

    alt Pandoc 进程异常
        PandocCLI --> Pandoc : 25a. PandocException\n(ExitCode, Stderr)
        Pandoc -> Engine : 25b. 抛出 PandocException
    else 正常完成
        PandocCLI --> Pandoc : 25c. 转换完成 (ExitCode=0)
    end
    deactivate PandocCLI

    Pandoc --> Engine : 26. DOCX 文件已生成
    deactivate Pandoc

    == 阶段6：OpenXML样式修正 ==

    Engine -> StyleCorrector : 27. ApplyAfdStyles(docxPath, template)
    activate StyleCorrector
    StyleCorrector -> StyleCorrector : 28. 打开 DOCX (OpenXML)\n遍历段落，匹配样式\n移除冗余内联属性\n应用 AFD 定义的字体/字号/对齐
    StyleCorrector --> Engine : 29. 样式修正完成
    deactivate StyleCorrector

    Engine -> StyleCorrector : 30. ApplyHeaderFooter(docxPath, headerFooter)
    activate StyleCorrector
    StyleCorrector --> Engine : 31. 页眉页脚已应用
    deactivate StyleCorrector

    == 阶段7：PDF转换（如需要） ==

    alt 导出格式 == PDF
        Engine -> StyleCorrector : 32. ApplyPdfLayout(docxPath,\npdfLayout, pdfConverter)
        activate StyleCorrector
        StyleCorrector -> StyleCorrector : 33. 双栏布局处理\n前置页检测\n宽表格跨栏处理
        StyleCorrector --> Engine : 34. PDF布局已处理
        deactivate StyleCorrector

        Engine -> PdfConv : 35. ConvertToPdf(docxPath, pdfPath)
        activate PdfConv
        note right of PdfConv
        <b>PDF转换策略链：</b>
        1. WordComPdfConverter (Windows COM)
        2. LibreOfficePdfConverter (headless)
        3. SyncfusionPdfConverter (兜底)
        按可用性自动选择。
        end note

        PdfConv -> PdfConv : 36. 尝试首选转换器\n失败则降级到下一个

        alt 所有转换器失败
            PdfConv --> Engine : 37a. InvalidOperationException
        else 转换成功
            PdfConv --> Engine : 37b. PDF 文件已生成
        end
        deactivate PdfConv
    end

    == 阶段8：返回结果 ==

    Engine -> Engine : 38. 清理临时文件\n(预处理MD、ref.docx)

    Engine -> Engine : 39. 格式化错误信息\nConversionErrorFormatter.ToUserMessage()

    Engine --> ConvertTab : 40. ConversionResult\n{Success, OutputPath, Format,\nPdfConverterName, ErrorMessage}
    deactivate Engine

    alt 导出成功
        ConvertTab --> User : 41a. 显示"导出成功"\n+ 输出文件路径
    else 导出失败
        ConvertTab --> User : 41b. 显示错误详情\n(用户友好的中文提示)
    end
    deactivate ConvertTab

    note right of User
    <b>转换管线总览：</b>
    MD → 预处理 → Pandoc(MD→DOCX)
    → OpenXML样式修正 → PDF(可选)
    全部本地执行，无网络依赖。
    end note

    @enduml
